<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#FDF6EE;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#FDF6EE;">Ingepakt en meegegeven aan de bezorger.͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ </div>
<table bgcolor="#FDF6EE" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#FDF6EE;" width="100%">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:0;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="t-wrap" role="presentation" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;" width="600">
<tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#E8622A" style="background-color:#E8622A;padding:12px 20px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.4;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:0.02em;">
        BUNDELKORTING - Bundel en bespaar
      </td></tr>
</table>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="t-wrap" role="presentation" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;" width="600">
<tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#FDF6EE" style="background-color:#FDF6EE;padding:26px 20px 24px;">
<a href="https://tabblie.com"><img alt="Tabblie" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0889/6128/6493/files/tabblie-logo-email.png" style="display:block;width:150px;max-width:150px;height:auto;border:0;margin:0 auto;" width="150"/></a>
</td></tr>
</table>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="t-wrap" role="presentation" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;" width="600">
<tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#BAC8E8" class="t-pad" style="background-color:#BAC8E8;padding:40px 40px 42px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#182D20;">Bestelling {{ order_name }}</p>
<h1 class="t-h1" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:40px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#182D20;">Ingepakt.<br/>En onderweg naar je.</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;font-weight:400;color:#182D20;font-size:17px;">Meestal ligt hij binnen 1 tot 2 werkdagen op de mat — en ja, hij past door de brievenbus.</p>
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="t-btn" role="presentation" style="margin:0 auto;">
<tr><td bgcolor="#182D20" style="border-radius:999px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr>
<td align="center" bgcolor="#E8622A" style="border-radius:999px;padding:0;margin:0;">
<a href="{{ fulfillment.tracking_url | default: order_status_url }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:18px 42px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;line-height:1;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;">{% if fulfillment.tracking_number != blank %}Volg je pakketje{% else %}Bekijk je bestelling{% endif %}</a>
</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr>
</table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td align="right" style="font-size:0;line-height:0;">
<span style="display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid #FFFFFF;border-radius:50%;background-color:#D8E2F3;"> </span>
<span style="display:inline-block;width:28px;height:28px;margin-left:8px;border:2px solid #FFFFFF;border-radius:50%;background-color:#D8E2F3;"> </span>
</td></tr></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0;"> </td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="t-wrap" role="presentation" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;" width="600">
<tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" class="t-pad" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;padding:40px 40px 42px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 24px;" width="100%">
<tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#E2F2ED" style="background-color:#E2F2ED;border-radius:18px;padding:24px 26px;">
            {% if fulfillment.tracking_company != blank %}<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#26523F;">Verzonden met {{ fulfillment.tracking_company }}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if fulfillment.tracking_number != blank %}<p style="margin:0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.03em;color:#26523F;">{{ fulfillment.tracking_number }}</p>
            {% else %}<p style="margin:0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;color:#26523F;">Je track &amp; trace verschijnt zodra de vervoerder het pakket gescand heeft.</p>{% endif %}
          </td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="t-wrap" role="presentation" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;" width="600">
<tr><td align="left" bgcolor="#FDF6EE" class="t-pad" style="background-color:#FDF6EE;padding:40px 40px 42px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E8622A;">Voor je eerste gebruik</p>
<h2 class="t-h2" style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:29px;line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#182D20;">Je eerste keer<br/>met Tabblie.</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;font-weight:400;color:#182D20;">Lees dit alvast even door. Dan kun je meteen goed beginnen zodra je pakketje opengaat.</p>

        {% if fulfillment.fulfillment_line_items.size > 1 %}
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 24px;" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:3px solid #182D20;border-radius:20px;padding:22px 22px 8px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E8622A;">Jouw Tabblie-routine</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;">Alles wat je kocht, in één oogopslag.</p>
            {% for fl in fulfillment.fulfillment_line_items %}{% assign item = fl.line_item %}
            {% if item.product.handle == 'tabblie-wasstrips' %}
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 14px;" width="100%"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#BAC8E8" style="width:12px;background-color:#BAC8E8;border-radius:8px;" width="12"> </td>
<td style="padding:2px 0 2px 14px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#182D20;"><strong style="display:block;font-size:16px;line-height:1.25;">Wasstrips</strong><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6B60;">Scheur af → leg onderin de trommel → start je programma.</span></td>
</tr></table>
            {% endif %}
            {% if item.product.handle == 'tabblie-vaatwasstrips' %}
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 14px;" width="100%"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#F2A0A0" style="width:12px;background-color:#F2A0A0;border-radius:8px;" width="12"> </td>
<td style="padding:2px 0 2px 14px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#182D20;"><strong style="display:block;font-size:16px;line-height:1.25;">Vaatwasstrips</strong><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6B60;">Scheur af → leg in mandje of tabletvak → start je programma.</span></td>
</tr></table>
            {% endif %}
            {% if item.product.handle == 'tabblie-toiletstrips' %}
              <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 14px;" width="100%"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#F5C842" style="width:12px;background-color:#F5C842;border-radius:8px;" width="12"> </td>
<td style="padding:2px 0 2px 14px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#182D20;"><strong style="display:block;font-size:16px;line-height:1.25;">Toiletstrips</strong><span style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6B60;">In de pot → 10–15 minuten wachten → borstelen en doorspoelen.</span></td>
</tr></table>
            {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </td></tr></table>
        {% else %}
        {% for fl in fulfillment.fulfillment_line_items %}{% assign item = fl.line_item %}
        {% if item.product.handle == 'tabblie-wasstrips' %}
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 16px;" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="#BAC8E8" style="background-color:#BAC8E8;border:3px solid #182D20;border-radius:18px;padding:20px 22px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;">Schone was. Zonder fles of maatdop.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#182D20;">Je wasmiddel is nu zo licht dat het door de brievenbus past. De strip doseert eenvoudig en gaat rechtstreeks bij je wasgoed.</p>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%">
<tr><td style="padding:3px 8px 3px 0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#26523F;" valign="top" width="24">✓</td><td style="padding:3px 0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#182D20;">Precies gedoseerd, dus geen geknoei of overdosering.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:3px 8px 3px 0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#26523F;" valign="top" width="24">✓</td><td style="padding:3px 0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#182D20;">Compact in de kast en geen zware wasmiddelfles.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:3px 8px 3px 0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#26523F;" valign="top" width="24">✓</td><td style="padding:3px 0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#182D20;">Lost op in koud en warm water, ook op de eco-stand.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E8622A;">Zo gebruik je je wasstrips</p>
<table align="left" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:90%;margin:0 auto 0 0;position:relative;z-index:1;transform:rotate(-1.2deg);" width="90%">
<tr><td bgcolor="#182D20" style="background-color:#182D20;border-radius:20px;padding:0 6px 6px 0;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="#FDF6EE" style="background-color:#FDF6EE;border:3px solid #182D20;border-radius:18px;padding:18px 20px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr>
<td style="padding-right:16px;" valign="middle" width="70"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#BAC8E8" height="54" style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:27px;border:3px solid #182D20;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;line-height:54px;" valign="middle" width="54">1</td></tr></table></td>
<td valign="middle">
<p style="margin:0 0 5px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;">Scheur een strip af langs de perforatie.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6B60;">Voor een kleine of licht vervuilde was is een halve strip genoeg.</p>
</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<table align="right" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:90%;margin:-10px 0 0 auto;position:relative;z-index:2;transform:rotate(1.4deg);" width="90%">
<tr><td bgcolor="#182D20" style="background-color:#182D20;border-radius:20px;padding:0 6px 6px 0;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="#FDF6EE" style="background-color:#FDF6EE;border:3px solid #182D20;border-radius:18px;padding:18px 20px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr>
<td style="padding-right:16px;" valign="middle" width="70"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#BAC8E8" height="54" style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:27px;border:3px solid #182D20;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;line-height:54px;" valign="middle" width="54">2</td></tr></table></td>
<td valign="middle">
<p style="margin:0 0 5px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;">Direct in de trommel bij je wasgoed.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6B60;">Niet in het wasmiddelbakje — daar blijft hij plakken.</p>
</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<table align="left" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:90%;margin:-10px auto 0 0;position:relative;z-index:3;transform:rotate(-0.7deg);" width="90%">
<tr><td bgcolor="#182D20" style="background-color:#182D20;border-radius:20px;padding:0 6px 6px 0;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="#FDF6EE" style="background-color:#FDF6EE;border:3px solid #182D20;border-radius:18px;padding:18px 20px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr>
<td style="padding-right:16px;" valign="middle" width="70"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#BAC8E8" height="54" style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:27px;border:3px solid #182D20;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;line-height:54px;" valign="middle" width="54">3</td></tr></table></td>
<td valign="middle">
<p style="margin:0 0 5px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;">Start je programma. Klaar.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6B60;">Lost volledig en zonder resten op in koud én warm water, ook op de eco-stand.</p>
</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td height="32" style="height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:0;"> </td></tr></table>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 32px;" width="100%">
<tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:3px solid #182D20;border-radius:16px;padding:16px 20px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#182D20;">Veilig voor witte én gekleurde was, en dermatologisch getest — dus ook voor babykleding en een gevoelige huid.</td></tr>
</table>
        {% endif %}
        {% if item.product.handle == 'tabblie-vaatwasstrips' %}
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 16px;" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="#F2A0A0" style="background-color:#F2A0A0;border:3px solid #182D20;border-radius:18px;padding:20px 22px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:21px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;color:#182D20;">Heldere vaat. Zonder zo'n lomp tablet.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#182D20;">Eén lichte strip doet het werk op een normaal, kort of eco-programma. Geen grote doos die ruimte inneemt.</p>
