<tr><td style="padding:3px 8px 3px 0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#26523F;" valign="top" width="24">✓</td><td style="padding:3px 0;font-family:'Baloo 2','Nunito','Trebuchet MS',Verdana,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#182D20;">Citroenzuur helpt tijdens het wassen tegen kalk.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
